            "review_text": "BigOilAdelaide\nAdelaide65 contributions\n0\nBest duck I have ever had.\nDec 2024 • Couples\nHappened across this place on one of the main roads and not the beach where its trip advisor address is? Settled in for a meal and was surprised by the best duck I have ever eaten. Half a duck, succulent, perfectly rendered, crispy and massive. Also had seafood noodles and spinach with garlic and a few beers. Friendly service and draught beer. Seriously, go there for the duck.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2024",
