            "review_text": "WelshJohn1959\nIstanbul, Türkiye87 contributions\n0\nGreat Menu of all types of Sea food\nJul 2018\nI did not stay here but came across it on my walk along the beach. Great views from the restaurant and the food is delicious with large helpings. We had NZ wine 50US$ and then crab/squid/rice/pork-veg soup/crab soup/vegetables.\n\nThe waitress was superb, excellent service. The weather was not too good and it rained but we were in a nice concrete covered pagoda, so we did not have to move. the final bill came to 120US$ but the food/company was good even if the weather wasn't.\n\nCannot give you any information on the hotel only the restaurant. It was rather full though with local tourists.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2018",
