            "review_text": "Mosaic Images\nHaworth, United Kingdom1196 contributions\n0\n“ more bad every time “\nApr 2018 • Solo\nI cannot in all honesty recommend here or the Grand to our clients. I like to think like me , we want life on the level.\n\nThis resort features cobbled steps to every level, after a time it becomes totally tiresome, forget the weekend it is manic\n\nI have already discarded the faded glory if the “ Grand”.... my comments about Grand follows.\n\nBy the way we have new Associate Viet Anh is joining us as Transport Guide\n\nWelcome aboard... ps the fact that after meetings I arrived back to find all facilities shut!!!!\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2018",
